  exerciseNumber: 06
  exerciseName: NotCrafting
  exerciseTitle: Not crafting
  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/63458728
  exerciseText: Not crafting anything
  hintText: Is it really not crafting? Check the Inventory System in the inspector
    while the game is playing.
  solutionText: 'The logic is working, it is crafting, but the UI is not updating
    because the event is never being fired.

    OnItemSOListChanged?.Invoke(this,
    EventArgs.Empty);'
